.TH MERMAN-CLI-THEME-INSPECT 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.10.0" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-theme\-inspect \- Validate the complete portable recipe and print schema\-1 inspection JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli theme inspect\fR [\fB\-\-resource\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-resource\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-operation\-timeout\-ms\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate the complete portable recipe and print schema\-1 inspection JSON.
.PP
Accepts a schema\-1 design or concrete complete_spec recipe. Render\-selection wrappers belong to render \-\-theme\-file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Theme recipe JSON file. Use `\-` for stdin
.SH "RESOURCE CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-resource\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR [default: trusted\-native]
Resource policy for input, semantic models, output, and CLI acquisition.

Use interactive for cooperative editor\-like workloads, constrained for untrusted or multi\-tenant input, and trusted\-native for controlled local workloads. The unbounded profile retains hard implementation and protocol guards.
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
interactive: General interactive applications and public binding surfaces
.IP \(bu 2
constrained: Constrained rendering for untrusted or publicly submitted documents
.IP \(bu 2
trusted\-native: Local CLI and controlled native batch rendering
.IP \(bu 2
unbounded\-for\-trusted\-input: Explicitly disable policy budgets while retaining hard backend capabilities
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-resource\-limit\fR \fI<STABLE_ID=POSITIVE_U64>\fR
Override a resource budget as STABLE_ID=POSITIVE_U64. Can be repeated
.SH "OPERATION CONTROL"
.TP
\fB\-\-operation\-timeout\-ms\fR \fI<MILLISECONDS>\fR
Cancel the complete command operation after this many milliseconds.

The deadline starts before input acquisition and covers generation, rendering, and publication. Zero cancels at the first cooperative checkpoint.
.SH VERSION
v0.10.0
